notes.content:
Winter Update for "Beyond your Fear". Featuring:
[list]
[*] [b]Localizations: [/b]Adding full language support for Spanish Portuguese(Brazilian), French and German;
[*] [b]Achievements:[/b] Three Achievements added for each ending;
[*] [b]UI Rework:[/b] Redesigned of the user interface to improve readability;
[*] [b]Performance Options Improvement:[/b] Each Performance option now works as intended, providing better result;
[*] [b]Sound Improvement:[/b] Added even more immersion compared from the last update.
[/list]
